    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.bufremove\n\n### Question\n\nIs it possible to automatically close tab if:\r\n1. There is >1 tab open\r\n2. Buffer that is being closed is the only buffer in the current tab\r\n\r\nUser story:\r\n1. I have 2 tabs open and edit `foo.bar` in the tab &#8470;2\r\n2. I call `MiniBufremove.wipeout()`\r\n3. I am left with an empty `[No Name]` tab\r\n\r\nExpected behaviour:\r\n- Empty tab &#8470;2 is closed automatically",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.bufremove</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is it possible to automatically close tab if:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>There is &gt;1 tab open</li>\n<li>Buffer that is being closed is the only buffer in the current tab</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">User story:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>I have 2 tabs open and edit <code class=\"notranslate\">foo.bar</code> in the tab №2</li>\n<li>I call <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniBufremove.wipeout()</code></li>\n<li>I am left with an empty <code class=\"notranslate\">[No Name]</code> tab</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Expected behaviour:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Empty tab №2 is closed automatically</li>\n</ul>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.bufremove\nQuestion\nIs it possible to automatically close tab if:\n\nThere is >1 tab open\nBuffer that is being closed is the only buffer in the current tab\n\nUser story:\n\nI have 2 tabs open and edit foo.bar in the tab №2\nI call MiniBufremove.wipeout()\nI am left with an empty [No Name] tab\n\nExpected behaviour:\n\nEmpty tab №2 is closed automatically",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
