                    "bodyText": "Appreciate the snippet. It \"sort of\" works, but not quite as expected. Consider the following:\n\n\n3 buffers opened in 3 tabs. nVim is showing tab 3:\n\n\n\nI execute my_wipeout(). Expected result: 2 tabs left with filetypes.lua (2nd tab) being active. Actual result:\n\n\n\nHow come?.. Let's check the :buffers:\n:buffers\n  1 %a   \"mini.lua\"                     line 8\n  3  h   \"diff.lua\"                     line 4\n\nSo, instead of diff.lua which was loaded in tab 3, the my_wipeout() removed inactive buffer filetypes.lua! Quite a twist.",
